## 4. Installation & Setup

### Prerequisites
* **Python 3.10+** (Added to system PATH)
* **Node.js & npm** (Required for PM2 and ngrok background management)
* **VS Code** with the **Cline** extension installed
* An active [ngrok account](https://ngrok.com/) for tunnel authentication

### Environment Preparation
1. **Clone the repository:**
   ```bash
   git clone [https://github.com/Saintt07/MCP-server-setup-.git](https://github.com/Saintt07/MCP-server-setup-.git)
   cd MCP-server-setup-
   ```

2. **Configure environment variables:**
   ```bash
   cp .env.example .env
   ```

3. **Install Python and Node dependencies:**
   ```bash
   pip install "m[cli]" fastmcp uvicorn pydantic
   npm install -g pm2
   ```

4. **Authenticate ngrok (First-time setup only):**
   ```bash
   ngrok config add-authtoken YOUR_NGROK_AUTH_TOKEN
   ```

