## 5. Server Execution Methods

### Option A: Manual Run (Development & Debugging)
Initialize the Python FastMCP server in your primary terminal:
```bash
python server.py
```
In a secondary terminal, establish the ngrok tunnel pointing to the server port:
```bash
ngrok http 8000
```

### Option B: Background Service (Production via PM2)
Deploy the server and tunnel silently as background daemon processes:
```bash
pm2 start ecosystem.config.js
```

