## 6. Client Integration (Cline Configuration)

To connect your VS Code AI assistant to the active server:
1. Copy your active public ngrok HTTPS URL (e.g., `https://xxxx.ngrok-free.app`).
2. Open your VS Code Cline MCP settings file (`cline_mcp_settings.json`).
3. Configure the server endpoint. **Note:** FastMCP's HTTP transport requires the `/mcp` routing path suffix.
   ```json
   {
     "mcpServers": {
       "connector": {
         "url": "[https://YOUR-NGROK-URL.ngrok-free.app/mcp](https://YOUR-NGROK-URL.ngrok-free.app/mcp)"
       }
     }
   }
   ```
4. Reload the VS Code window (`Ctrl+Shift+P` -> **Developer: Reload Window**) to initialize the tool registry.

